Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.91,0:00:05.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digitama, Digitamamon,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.34,0:00:11.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,senori,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.00,0:00:16.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Small tea. Full speed at the train.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.22,0:00:19.27,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Furusupiido de mawari hajimeta sutoorii
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.08,0:00:23.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep going on for no reason,\Ndon't forget to play.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.27,0:00:24.11,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,akaku daichi someageru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.40,0:00:31.66,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chikyuugi ni wa garandou ni natta paradise
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.18,0:00:33.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.66,0:00:36.33,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Bokura no te de sukuidasou
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.29,0:00:42.96,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Hateshinaku tsuzuku sakamichi o
Dialogue: 1,0:00:42.96,0:00:47.67,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ima omoikiri kakenukete far away
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.34,0:00:57.18,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Tachiagare! Yuusha wa boku no naka ni iru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.81,0:01:03.69,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sobietatsu target makeru wake ni wa ikanai
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.69,0:01:09.74,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Moeagare! Kodou wa mune o kogashiteru
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.24,0:01:06.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.64,0:01:07.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.04,0:01:13.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.74,0:01:16.37,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Wasurerareta ashita torimodoshi ni ikun da
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.76,0:01:20.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.37,0:01:21.50,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Atsui batoru okose
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.94,0:01:23.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.08,0:01:33.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was great meeting Mimi,\Nwho was visiting from America.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.52,0:01:34.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's so glamorous.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.86,0:01:38.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We all decided to spend our Saturday\Npicnicking in the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.30,0:01:40.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything was going great,\Nexcept for the food fight,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.92,0:01:42.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when some of us got\Nseparated and fell into a
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.92,0:01:45.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,new area that was controlled\Nby a control spire.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.02,0:01:48.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why the Gekkomon\Ndidn't remember Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.36,0:01:51.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But luckily, Palmon remembered\Nher and saved us from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.30,0:01:53.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were happy to see each other,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.26,0:01:55.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but we weren't happy to\Nsee the Roachmon brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.42,0:01:58.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, we made them destroy\Nthe Control Spire for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.60,0:02:00.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish Mimi were staying.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.18,0:02:02.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I almost feel like we're sisters.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.75,0:02:09.92,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fscx125\fscy125\pos(321,325)}Hikari's Memories
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.82,0:02:08.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daddy no kyo-ku.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.18,0:02:11.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ta-da!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.46,0:02:14.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.46,0:02:19.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, that's 12 more\NControl Spires destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.44,0:02:23.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.18,0:02:26.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,According to the map,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.42,0:02:29.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Greymon has finished in this area\Nand is moving on to the next.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.04,0:02:32.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gorillamon's doing the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.66,0:02:36.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's still one more control\Nspire to destroy today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.90,0:02:38.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe Greymon could get that one too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.86,0:02:40.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think he can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.28,0:02:42.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like he's too far from that area.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.36,0:02:43.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ty's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.36,0:02:45.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that case, we'll do it ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.46,0:02:56.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am Guardromon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.28,0:02:57.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,whoever tries to enter the premises shall
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.98,0:03:00.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,become victims of my\Ngrenade destroyer attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.54,0:03:01.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gold Rush!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.22,0:03:04.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Star Shower!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.56,0:03:07.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire Rocket!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.76,0:03:11.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Intruder, Intruder!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.46,0:03:13.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There must be a hundred of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.14,0:03:16.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, you counted that high without\Neven taking off your shoes and socks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.02,0:03:19.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think now's a good time\Nto go back to our world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.92,0:03:21.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can come up with a new plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.56,0:03:22.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,T.K.'s right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.47,0:03:23.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can talk to Izzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.62,0:03:25.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Intruder! Intruder!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.42,0:03:28.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you guys out of your minds? Quit now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.02,0:03:30.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never been a quitter!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.54,0:03:31.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.45,0:03:32.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis, let's regroup.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.14,0:03:36.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis, don't be so stubborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.98,0:03:38.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are far too many of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.32,0:03:40.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to get out of here while we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.46,0:03:42.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I agree. We have to hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.46,0:03:47.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, head for the gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.76,0:03:51.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digiport, open!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.96,0:04:03.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grenade destroyer!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.08,0:04:03.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.48,0:04:08.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.39,0:04:10.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say, shouldn't we put pillows here\Nif we're going to keep doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.84,0:04:15.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guys, I saw that the TV was blown up as\Nwe came through, so we can't go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.36,0:04:16.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.42,0:04:17.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did Kari go?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.78,0:04:18.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's trapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.98,0:04:20.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.58,0:04:26.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think this has spell check.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.08,0:04:32.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari, if we find ourselves in any kind\Nof jam, I can always arm or digivolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.34,0:04:34.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, let's save that\Nfor a special occasion.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.02,0:04:36.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The gate to that area is closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.12,0:04:38.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't get to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.94,0:04:39.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,T.K.,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.85,0:04:43.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wasn't Kari right behind you when you\Nwent into the gate from the digital world?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.12,0:04:43.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.03,0:04:45.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then it's all your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.08,0:04:47.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you let her go first? Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.58,0:04:48.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was no one's fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.76,0:04:49.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It just happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.68,0:04:50.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.59,0:04:51.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a little kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.54,0:04:54.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but I still know when\Nsomeone's being a jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.36,0:04:56.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I guess that's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.94,0:04:59.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Truth is, Davis is right. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.60,0:05:02.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It really was my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.44,0:05:05.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should have been watching\Nout for her all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.98,0:05:08.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess I could have, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.40,0:05:09.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So could I.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.62,0:05:10.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.92,0:05:12.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no one to blame.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.48,0:05:14.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.78,0:05:17.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys, it's an email from Kari. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.06,0:05:22.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It says, don't worry, I'm all right, and\NI'm sorry if any words are misspelled.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.12,0:05:23.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sincerely, Kari.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.52,0:05:24.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yoli, I've got an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.94,0:05:28.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I can find an area close to the\None she's in, then I can reach her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.68,0:05:29.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.16,0:05:31.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be back soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.82,0:05:32.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.88,0:05:35.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.86,0:05:40.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he thinks I'm going to stand by and\Nlet him be the hero, he can forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.88,0:05:41.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.79,0:05:42.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I'm going.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.71,0:05:43.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yoli, wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.84,0:05:46.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, it's almost dinner time right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.14,0:05:48.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somewhere between the green\Nsalad and the green gelatin,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.42,0:05:50.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,their families are going\Nto wonder where they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.66,0:05:52.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to tell Tai and the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.74,0:05:57.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think that's the best thing you and I\Ncan do to help Davis and TK right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.08,0:05:58.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cody, I know you're just a kid,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.54,0:06:01.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but sometimes you have the\Nwisdom of an old man of 20.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.18,0:06:02.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, what are we waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.96,0:06:03.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.87,0:06:05.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But wait, you can't just go out in public.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.64,0:06:10.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This was a great idea, crossing\Nthe desert without any water.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.18,0:06:11.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, I didn't ask for your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.02,0:06:13.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's the city!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.18,0:06:17.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like one of those things\Nyou shake and it starts snowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.30,0:06:18.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll go get Kari.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.34,0:06:19.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.25,0:06:20.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'll get Kari.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.58,0:06:21.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.88,0:06:23.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, I'll tell you what.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.18,0:06:24.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll flip for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.44,0:06:26.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Winner goes, loser stays here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.52,0:06:29.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since it's my coin, I\Nget to call it. Tails.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.10,0:06:33.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, if it's tails, I rescue Kari.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.70,0:06:35.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it's heads, you get to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.10,0:06:37.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tails!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.72,0:06:41.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll tell her that you were\Nworried about her and that you...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.48,0:06:44.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh, a coin that has tails on both sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.68,0:06:46.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's how I used to beat Matt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.78,0:06:47.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.92,0:06:50.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's both go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.10,0:06:56.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, TM, did you really use\None of those coins on Matt?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.28,0:07:00.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's how I got all my\Nbaseball cards and his old guitar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.94,0:07:05.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,T.K. and Davis sure argue a lot. How come?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.28,0:07:06.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something about Kari.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.84,0:07:09.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Human girls make human\Nboys act sort of weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.20,0:07:14.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Intruder! Intruder! Intruder!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.66,0:07:16.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rosetta Stone!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.64,0:07:23.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari, there aren't any\NTVs left in this area.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.64,0:07:26.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll have to go to\Nanother area to find one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.46,0:07:29.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we don't even know\Nwhich direction to travel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.68,0:07:32.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's almost your dinner time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.84,0:07:35.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't you be going home soon, Ken?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.62,0:07:39.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never calling anything but master!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.58,0:07:44.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since she's all alone,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.26,0:07:48.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she deserves someone special.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.64,0:07:53.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, you can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.68,0:07:54.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyone but him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.90,0:07:59.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.81,0:08:00.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I speak to Tai, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.44,0:08:03.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm not selling anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.08,0:08:04.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, Yoli,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.24,0:08:07.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with all the snacks and drinks\Nyou take to give your friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.68,0:08:10.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's a wonder this store\Nshows any profit at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.22,0:08:11.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Put it on my tab, Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.52,0:08:13.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's where Kari is now, Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.94,0:08:14.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, Cody.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.94,0:08:16.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for letting me know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.22,0:08:17.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.28,0:08:18.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.54,0:08:24.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari's at a friend's house doing\Na science project on gravity,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.12,0:08:26.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and they need to see how\Nlong I can stand on my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.46,0:08:27.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.56,0:08:28.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.47,0:08:29.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Tai, I heard what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.39,0:08:30.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, are you going to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.30,0:08:31.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, in a few minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.40,0:08:33.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But first, I have to make\Na stop by Davis' apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.86,0:08:35.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to make up a\Nstory to tell his family
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.64,0:08:37.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that he's going to be\Na little late tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.38,0:08:39.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, don't worry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.18,0:08:40.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can take care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.66,0:08:42.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You go on and get to Kari. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.94,0:08:43.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Matt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.14,0:08:44.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.05,0:08:47.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I left Mimi on hold when\Nshe called from New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.86,0:08:48.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her phone bill!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.20,0:08:51.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told my mom we were\Nworking on a rescue project.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.54,0:08:53.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She said she's glad we're helping\Nstray cats in the neighborhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.92,0:08:57.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, my dad was just glad that I\Nleft without filling up another bag
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.18,0:09:03.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's just one guard at the door. We're
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.74,0:09:05.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,gonna have to take him\Nout in the first attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.04,0:09:09.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, he'll call for\Nreinforcements Not a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.28,0:09:11.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vimon and I can handle that metalhead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.54,0:09:12.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vimon, are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.20,0:09:14.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.60,0:09:16.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did y'all - Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.72,0:09:17.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.68,0:09:20.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There aren't any control\Nspires in this area, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.28,0:09:22.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, just the one inside the dome
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.92,0:09:28.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we're outside. Yeah, that's\Nright. That means you can Digivolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.10,0:09:31.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then go for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.16,0:10:16.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angemon, I haven't seen you\Nin a while. An? An? Angemon?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.82,0:10:18.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi there, big guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.92,0:10:24.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angel Rod!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.64,0:10:26.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angel Roder!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.10,0:10:32.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I nailed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.88,0:10:51.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know those control\Nspires really ruined my day.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.44,0:10:52.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did great, Patamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.08,0:10:56.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, besides Armor Digivolving,\NPatamon can Digivolve to Angemon?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.28,0:10:58.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about Gatomon?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.56,0:11:01.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, she can digivolve to Angewomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.50,0:11:02.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.02,0:11:06.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angewomon and Angewomon? That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.26,0:11:08.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We make a great team. One question.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.68,0:11:10.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there an Angewomon, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.18,0:11:13.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sometimes he says the weirdest things.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.10,0:11:16.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,V-mon! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.62,0:11:21.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me right now if you can\Ndigivolve an Angie-something, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.24,0:11:24.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, Angie Dinosaurmon,\NAngie Soccerplayermon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.68,0:11:26.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just don't have it in me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.74,0:11:28.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's still got a lot to learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.84,0:11:31.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.88,0:11:33.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis is over at my brother's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.48,0:11:36.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and so he probably won't be\Nhome until a little later on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.56,0:11:39.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.48,0:11:40.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.20,0:11:42.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.11,0:11:45.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can tell when people are lying, because\Nthey usually start blinking a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.46,0:11:46.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.50,0:11:49.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise not to tell my\Nparents you were lying
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.74,0:11:51.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if you promise to go\Nout on a date with me,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.60,0:11:52.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.51,0:11:53.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you Friday at 8.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.92,0:11:56.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did that happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.32,0:12:02.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How come you get some\Nmore candy than I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.96,0:12:05.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop complaining, there's plenty more.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.08,0:12:07.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I brought some reinforcements.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.22,0:12:09.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.62,0:12:14.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You summoned me, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.78,0:12:16.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please hold for the Digimon Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.94,0:12:18.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Line one for you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.18,0:12:42.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are energized!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.24,0:12:44.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.76,0:12:47.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beemon, Armor Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.72,0:12:53.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Patamon, Armored Digimon, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.72,0:12:58.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armored Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.18,0:13:09.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, Digital Monsters,\NGlendramon, the Fire of Courage!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.46,0:13:16.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, Digital Monsters,\NPegasmon, Flying Hope!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.54,0:13:18.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire Rocket!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.64,0:13:23.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.55,0:13:26.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,over here I can't jump as\Nhigh as you can I'm getting
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.86,0:13:31.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari's signal. We're close. You\Nready to jump a little higher?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.32,0:13:36.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It really doesn't matter\Nwhat you try. It's getting
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.30,0:13:41.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even harder to deny Cause\Nreality has just said goodbye
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.94,0:13:45.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rene destroyer
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.74,0:13:50.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.65,0:13:52.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's getting ready to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.26,0:13:56.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It starts happening all over again!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.08,0:13:58.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Intruder destroyed!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.92,0:14:01.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Equus B!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.26,0:14:03.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire rocket!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.98,0:14:10.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Davis! TK!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.22,0:14:12.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys are my heroes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.70,0:14:16.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, it was mostly my idea, but I\Ndecided to bring TK out for the ride!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.96,0:14:17.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.20,0:14:19.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.46,0:14:22.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Star Shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.26,0:14:30.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Kari, we better get going. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.94,0:14:38.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why can't these guys ever be small?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.90,0:14:39.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Andromon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.54,0:14:43.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am Andromon. I have one mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.30,0:14:46.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seek out my enemy and destroy\Nhim with my lightning blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.88,0:14:47.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.94,0:14:49.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.85,0:14:51.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got a dark ring. Andromon?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.32,0:14:54.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am programmed to destroy the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.94,0:14:56.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.48,0:14:57.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will destroy you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.52,0:14:59.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Andromon, don't you remember us?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.38,0:15:00.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.86,0:15:02.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari, you're hanging around\Nwith the wrong people.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.94,0:15:05.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fladramon, you'll have\Nto use all your power.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.10,0:15:06.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.82,0:15:08.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Flaming Fist!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.82,0:15:10.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Flaming Blade!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.44,0:15:19.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,V-mon, speak to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.36,0:15:21.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're kneeling on my tail!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.06,0:15:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Star Shower!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.08,0:15:27.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lightning Blade!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.10,0:15:35.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll have two cheeseburgers\Nand a large order of fries!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.12,0:15:37.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That didn't work!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.62,0:15:38.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.76,0:15:43.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Andromon, don't you remember\Nhow we fought together?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.44,0:15:44.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Side by side?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.42,0:15:46.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari, we have to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.62,0:15:49.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't even know if\Nit's the same Andromon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.20,0:15:50.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure that it's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.80,0:15:54.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but even if it is, he's under\Nthe control of the Digimon Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.34,0:15:56.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can't even hear your voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.22,0:15:57.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.54,0:16:01.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As much as I like you two arguing,\Nhe's heading right for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.38,0:16:08.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.78,0:16:16.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here comes help now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.92,0:16:18.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad we're not too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.80,0:16:20.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.14,0:16:25.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought since I was here, I'd\Nbuild this city a subway system!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.78,0:16:28.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold still, you pile of scrap metal!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.04,0:16:29.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gold rush!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.14,0:16:36.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, that comment about\Nscrap metal was just a joke!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.22,0:16:38.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.60,0:16:40.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but Tai, it's Andromon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.64,0:16:43.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Andromon, slow down!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.42,0:16:45.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's me, Tai!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.16,0:16:47.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai who?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.50,0:16:54.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Tai!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.40,0:16:58.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.34,0:17:02.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Corrine, look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.44,0:17:11.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you put her down now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.00,0:17:16.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you remember me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.52,0:17:19.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.10,0:17:25.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.98,0:17:28.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We all took a picture together.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.40,0:17:36.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.88,0:17:54.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Paces, long ago, Digidestined,\NI love jigsaw puzzles.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.28,0:17:57.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I see the complete picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.52,0:18:10.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari, I'm sorry for the\Ntrouble I've caused.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.02,0:18:14.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Andromon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.42,0:18:15.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.80,0:18:21.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That control spire is\Nresponsible for all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.84,0:18:23.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.68,0:18:24.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gatling, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.78,0:18:35.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Andromon, are all of these Garudamon\Ngoing to stay broken forever?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.98,0:18:36.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.89,0:18:39.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their programs were rewritten\Nby the Digimon Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.22,0:18:43.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They just need to be reprogrammed. Watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.60,0:18:48.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.52,0:18:50.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,once I reprogram the Garudamon,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.44,0:18:54.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll stay here to protect them in\Ncase the Digimon Emperor returns.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.88,0:18:56.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ideal precious, a daisy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.06,0:18:58.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.02,0:18:59.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.70,0:19:10.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Izzy, were you waiting this whole time?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.04,0:19:13.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shh. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.70,0:19:19.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt just called and told me\Nwhat had happened with Kari And
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.00,0:19:22.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really upset that you guys\Nhave left me out of the loop
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.52,0:19:25.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cody called Tai for help and\NTai called Matt But no one ever
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.58,0:19:29.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,calls me until the adventure\Nis all over with Come on Izzy,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.28,0:19:31.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't be like that There was\Njust no time to call you You know
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.98,0:19:35.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're a big part of the team\NThat's right And as a team member,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.64,0:19:37.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I expect to be treated\Nwith the same respect I
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.56,0:19:40.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,give to all of you I may\Nnot be as strong as you or
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.34,0:19:42.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt But I've gotten us\Nout of just as many jams
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.46,0:19:45.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with my particular skills\NI'm sorry I didn't call you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.84,0:19:47.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that's what I call respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.46,0:19:48.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, I forgive you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.84,0:19:50.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, that was easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.28,0:19:52.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I almost forgot\Nthe reason I came here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.18,0:19:56.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I examined the new digivices and determined\Nthat they have three different settings.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.18,0:19:57.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digital, Detect, and Discover.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.96,0:20:00.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe we should call them D3s from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.60,0:20:02.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prodigis little devices, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.02,0:20:06.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had a lot of help with the research\Nfrom my friend Willis in America.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.30,0:20:07.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe you guys will meet him someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.74,0:20:10.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I think the D3s might have sent\Na message to Andromon's memory banks,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.06,0:20:11.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which then made him...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.97,0:20:14.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please finish talking after we eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.62,0:20:17.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We forgot about dinner. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.10,0:20:19.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our parents are waiting for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.92,0:20:22.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The food's probably cold and soggy by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.22,0:20:23.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, for my mom,\Nthat's an improvement.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.00,0:20:24.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.70,0:20:27.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some girl named June called today, Matt,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.74,0:20:29.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and she said you have a\Ndate with her on Friday.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.82,0:20:31.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She wanted me to tell you that she made
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.36,0:20:34.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,dinner reservations for\Nyou two at Morreale's.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.30,0:20:35.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Morreale's?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.21,0:20:36.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.13,0:20:37.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The most expensive restaurant in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.50,0:20:38.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is old Davis' fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.02,0:20:42.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I have to\Ntake his sister out on a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.60,0:20:44.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Matt, something smells great.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.84,0:20:45.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm getting hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.50,0:20:47.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dinner's ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.58,0:20:51.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Supper time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.40,0:20:54.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken, dear, you're busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.54,0:20:56.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll leave it outside your door.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.38,0:21:05.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Glass, those digivices are\Nbecoming a nuisance to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.58,0:21:08.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to get them away from those kids.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:16.48,0:21:22.60,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chotto matte mite dare datte kinou to maru de chigau
Dialogue: 1,0:21:22.60,0:21:28.59,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chotto mite mite yokogao no shiruetto mo otona sa
Dialogue: 1,0:21:28.59,0:21:34.50,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chotto kimi kimi iiwake wo shitai kimochi mo wakaru
Dialogue: 1,0:21:34.50,0:21:40.67,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Datte yo no naka kore ja maru de natte nai jan
Dialogue: 1,0:21:40.67,0:21:46.69,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Da ne! Kimochi ii kuuki wo
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.58,0:21:44.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sub indo by broth3rmax I got\Na good feeling in the mood
Dialogue: 1,0:21:46.69,0:21:52.52,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ima! Suitakute shou ga nai shou ga nai
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.40,0:21:51.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will take it off, but it won't be.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:52.52,0:21:58.25,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ashita wa atashi no kaze ga fuku kara ne
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.54,0:21:58.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The next day, my wind will blow so.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:58.25,0:22:04.24,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sekaijuu no doa akete oite hoshii
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.56,0:22:03.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Door to the world, I want\Nyou to open the door.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:04.24,0:22:10.14,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ashita wa atashi no kaze ga fuku kara ne
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.52,0:22:07.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The next day, my wind will blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.70,0:22:11.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will turn the door
Dialogue: 1,0:22:10.14,0:22:19.00,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Kimi no sono yowamushi wo mouretsu ni fukitobasuyo
Dialogue: 1,0:22:20.60,0:22:29.40,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Gorgeous na jinsei wo!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:54.04,0:22:57.17,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)\fscx110\fscy110\pos(319,317)}The Digimon Kaiser's Loneliness

